<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador June inflation 1.39 pct - official.</title>
<headline>Ecuador June inflation 1.39 pct - official.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's consumer price inflation was 1.39 percent in June, down from 1.4 percent in June last year and 1.53 percent this May, the government's Institute of Statistics said Monday.</p>
<p>Annual inflation was 31.11 percent in June, the institute said. It did not provide figures for annual inflation in May or in June last year.</p>
<p>((-- Franz Bastidas, Quito Newsroom +5932 25-8429))</p>
